    "z0": 4420,
    "x1": 19040,
    "z1": 5780
   },
   "text": "LOGGING CAMP 4. Someone's clawed the sign.\nThe gate's hanging open."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 18360,
    "z0": 4080,
    "x1": 20400,
    "z1": 6120
   },
   "text": "The outside of the gate is clawed to splinters.\nSomething wanted in."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 11560,
    "z0": 6800,
    "x1": 15300,
    "z1": 8500
   },
   "text": "A logger, dead over the logs they piled up. The crows have had his eyes."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 22440,
    "z0": 11220,
    "x1": 25500,
    "z1": 13260
   },
   "text": "The camp truck, shoved out of the gate.\nBloody hands all over the inside of the door. Someone wanted out."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 8840,
    "z0": 7820,
    "x1": 14620,
    "z1": 11900
   },
   "text": "The barricade. Logs, sandbags, spikes. Pulled down, or pushed."
  }
 ],
 "entry": "They shut themselves in. It didn't help.",
